units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
newton on
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001

variable a equal 3.3
variable nx equal 20
variable ny equal 20
variable nz_t equal 40
variable nz_p equal 20
variable gap equal 15.0

variable Lx equal v_a*v_nx
variable Ly equal v_a*v_ny
variable Lz_t equal v_a*v_nz_t
variable Lz_p equal v_a*v_nz_p
variable zlo_p equal v_Lz_t+v_gap
variable zhi_p equal v_Lz_t+v_gap+v_Lz_p
variable Lz equal v_zhi_p

lattice bcc ${a} orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region whole block 0 v_Lx 0 v_Ly 0 v_Lz units box
create_box 1 whole

region target block 0 v_Lx 0 v_Ly 0 v_Lz_t units box
region proj block 0 v_Lx 0 v_Ly v_zlo_p v_zhi_p units box
create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region proj

group target region target
group projectile region proj
group all union target projectile

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /scratch/gilbreth/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt3.potential Nb
mass 1 92.90638

thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz

velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

fix nvt all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
run 10
unfix nvt

velocity projectile add 0.0 0.0 -20.0 sum yes

fix nve all nve
run 10
